[8.304233, "o", "c370014fc docs: changelog: the entries of this branch link #42\r\n29f1be4a7 docs: changelog: the matrix runs jungfrau at its RUNBOOK rate (fe85cb883)\r\nfe85cb883 sim: daq_sim matrix runs jungfrau at 100 Hz, as the RUNBOOK and the types branches run it (up --rate 100)\r\n5a6387ea1 tests: the camera PV test opens the PV as a client's first channel does (145f3da63)\r\n09f5fe236 sim: coverage's procmgr-instance rule (pr/stack) covers the GUIs and monitors, not pr/tail3's servers\r\nbfc1ccd3d sim: daq_sim matrix --gpu-host G runs the GPU DRP's types on G, beside the other types\r\n"]
[8.322599, "o", "6bb511313 sim: up --det <type> takes PSDAQ_SIM_PYTHONPATH_<type> as its PSDAQ_SIM_PYTHONPATH, so one matrix command runs tt and epixhr2x2\r\nf8f095bc6 docs: RUNBOOK sections in one order: the GPU DRP 3h, the types 3i-3l, then MEB/AMI 3m, features 3n, two nodes 3o, matrix 3p\r\nce2bd2cfe sim, tests: where the merged branches meet (coverage's served-value rule, cnf keys, drp_gpu rows)\r\n6d0663cee Merge pr/tail3 (649632d3f: lclsBldServer, hpsBldServer and hpsBldCopy on stand-ins, wave8pvs in a site env) into pr/final\r\naacd79f34 docs: drp_gpu -D epixuhr3x2 in the runbook and the changelog; det:drp_gpu:epixuhr3x2 RUN\r\n0752cb83c sim: drp_gpu -D epixuhr3x2 -d sim://, its calibration DB a loopback stand-in\r\n3165ec8ab psana: drpgpu epixuhr3x2_noOp_0_0_0, so psana reads what drp_gpu -D epixuhr3x2 records\r\nea351cf89 Merge pr/typesall (0835d02ab: hsd, epixquad1kfps, epixUHR, epixuhr3x2, jungfrau, epixhr2x2, tt, drp_gpu jungfrau, tt's old entri\r\n652c573e3 Merge pr/stack (dc482a707: MEB/AMI/system DRPs, features a-e, programs, coverage witnesses, two hosts, matrix, drp_pva camera PV\r\n\u001b]0;cwang31@sdfiana025:/sdf/data/lcls/ds/prj/prjcwang31/scratch/main/agentify-lcls2/wt-final\u0007\u001b[1;32mcwang31@sdfiana025\u001b[0m:\u001b[1;34mwt-final\u001b[0m$ "]
